# AI/assistant name tokens - the ONE list behind every attribution stripper in the kit:
# tools/hooks/commit-msg (sh) and safe-agent-push.{sh,ps1}. One extended-regex alternative
# per line, case-insensitive; '#' starts a comment. Widen here to cover a new harness, never
# relax a name into a common word (gpt-?[0-9], not a bare "gpt"). commit-msg carries a
# built-in copy for a target that lacks this file; test-hooks asserts the two stay equal.
cursor
claude
copilot
chatgpt
openai
anthropic
codex
gemini
grok
xai
gpt-?[0-9]
devin
aider
cowork
